Package: pvcor
Type: Package
Title: Orthogonal Pseudo-Outcome Regression for Conditional Correlation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tyler", "Grimes", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tyler.grimes@unf.edu")
Description: Cross-fitted, Neyman-orthogonal pseudo-outcomes for the conditional
    correlation of two features given covariates (and for the conditional partial
    correlation of a small set of features), with best-linear-projection and
    tanh-link second stages and heteroscedasticity-consistent inference. Also
    jackknife (LIONESS-type) pseudo-values for Pearson and partial correlation and
    the comparators used in the accompanying paper.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/tgrimes/pvcor
BugReports: https://github.com/tgrimes/pvcor/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: mgcv, stats, splines
Suggests: knitr, limma, ranger, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
